  "title": "Skillet Ham, Cabbage, and Potatoes",
  "description": "Ham, cabbage, and potatoes are cooked with tender onions and seasoned with paprika to make this simple but satisfying main dish in just one pan.",
  "authors": [
    "Priscilla Eibl"
  ],
